    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d612">

                <pb facs="1067" n="933" xml:id="pg933"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">761.93/7–1245: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 612<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Harriman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the President and
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract]<anchor n="1" xml:id="d612-f1"/></seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Moscow</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-07-12">12 July 1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Personal and top secret for the President and the Secretary of State from
                        Harriman.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . .</p>
                <p>
                    Soong suggested to Stalin that he return to Chungking to consult
                    the Generalissimo over the points still at issue.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d612-f2"/>
                    Stalin however said that it was better
                    to come to agreement before he met you at Berlin as he wished to decide with you
                    date of his entry into the war. …</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . .</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d612-f1" n="1" xml:id="d612-f1-content">
                <p>For the full text of this message, see <ref target="#d577">document No.
                    577</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d612-f2" n="2" xml:id="d612-f2-content">
                <p>In the Sino-Soviet negotiations being conducted at Moscow. See <ref
                        target="#d577">document No. 577</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
